2026-07-27T08:19:00.8699892Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:19:00.8700811Z i /tmp/Rtmpxv7Z2v/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:19:00.8701184Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:19:00.8701610Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:19:00.8702186Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:19:00.8702771Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:19:00.8703627Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:19:00.8704649Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
